                "text": "As a Member of Congress, I will be voting no on the House GOP Reproductive Health Care Surveillance Act, and as a doctor I urge all my colleagues to oppose this bill.\n\nNo one, especially politicians, has the right to tell a me how to tend to my patients. https://t.co/wfVKdn4gSz",
