                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I worked at VA hospitals. The system isn\u2019t perfect, but it\u2019s the backbone of our promise to veterans\u2014and it delivers better outcomes for them than anywhere else.\n\nTrump\u2019s admin betrayed that promise: cutting VA staff, slashing mental health care, and firing more veterans than ever before.\n\nWe must protect veterans\u2019 benefits. No exceptions.",
