                "text": "2. They\u2019ve stalled cancer breakthroughs.\n\nThere was a major breakthrough for colon cancer treatment, but now it\u2019s on hold thanks to government layoffs. Clinical trials are delayed, even for patients already enrolled.\n\n(Reminder: 1 in 4 Americans will face colon cancer.)",
