                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Doctors are too often forced to choose between the care their patients need and what insurance will cover. The result is worse health outcomes and growing mistrust between patients and their doctors.\n\nCongress must act to expand access to affordable care and fix our broken healthcare system.",
